{
  "declaredLength": 4356,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "人生路上！\n劲敌不可或缺！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA751F8DEF4E0AFF01000A52B2654C4E0D53EF62167F3AFF01FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说得没错！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF45F976CA19519FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你还好吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608FD8597D5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF95427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不好！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D597DFF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，你来当我的劲敌吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C4F6067655F536211768452B2654C5427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我懂你的困惑！\n但你听我说！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621161C24F60768456F060D1FF01000A4F464F60542C62118BF4FF01FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们在同一天出生，\n开始培育同样的宝可梦，炭小侍。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC5728540C4E00592951FA751FFF0C000A5F0059CB57F980B2540C683776845B9D53EF68A6FF0C70AD5C0F4F8D300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "炭小侍是一种能根据道具\n完成2种进化的宝可梦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70AD5C0F4F8D662F4E0079CD80FD6839636E90535177000A5B8C6210003279CD8FDB531676845B9D53EF68A6FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但炭小侍它们不能一直维持现状\n走同一条路……毕竟是劲敌嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4670AD5C0F4F8D5B834EEC4E0D80FD4E0076F47EF4630173B072B6000A8D70540C4E0067618DEF202620266BD57ADF662F52B2654C561B300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一只成为红莲铠骑，\n另一只成为苍炎刃鬼。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我们彼此都让炭小侍进化！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0053EA62104E3A7EA283B294E09A91FF0C000A53E64E0053EA62104E3A82CD708E52039B3C300200100001BE00000A62114EEC5F7C6B6490FD8BA970AD5C0F4F8D8FDB5316FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然后，某一天……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136540EFF0C67D04E0059292026202600100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们如同命中注定一样重逢，\n让红莲铠骑和苍炎刃鬼对战，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n一决胜负！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC5982540C547D4E2D6CE85B9A4E00683791CD9022FF0C000A8BA97EA283B294E09A91548C82CD708E52039B3C5BF96218FF0C00100001BE00000A4E0051B380DC8D1FFF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我本来梦想着这种热血的故事，\n但别说是和我同一天出生的劲敌，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就连一个朋友我都没有！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以，你来当我的劲敌吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211672C676568A660F377408FD979CD70ED8840768465454E8BFF0C000A4F46522B8BF4662F548C6211540C4E00592951FA751F768452B2654CFF0C00100001BE00000A5C318FDE4E004E2A670B53CB621190FD6CA16709FF0100100001BE00000A62404EE5FF0C4F6067655F536211768452B2654C5427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不用担心！让炭小侍进化的\n庆祝之铠和咒术之铠我都有。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D752862C55FC3FF018BA970AD5C0F4F8D8FDB53167684000A5E86795D4E4B94E0548C5492672F4E4B94E0621190FD6709300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我把其中一个让给你！\n所以你要让炭小侍进化，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n然后让我实现理想中的对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211628A51764E2D4E004E2A8BA97ED94F60FF01000A62404EE54F6089818BA970AD5C0F4F8D8FDB5316FF0C00100001BE00000A7136540E8BA962115B9E73B0740660F34E2D76845BF962185427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等你决定选择哪个铠甲之后，\n再来告诉我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494F6051B35B9A900962E954EA4E2A94E075324E4B540EFF0C000A518D6765544A8BC962115427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你已经决定选哪个铠甲了啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F605DF27ECF51B35B9A900954EA4E2A94E075324E86554AFF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "庆祝之铠",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E86795D4E4B94E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咒术之铠",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5492672F4E4B94E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很难决定",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F8896BE51B35B9A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想和你来场命运之战！\n你就好好烦恼一番吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3548C4F606765573A547D8FD04E4B6218FF01000A4F605C31597D597D70E6607C4E00756A5427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "庆祝之铠……\n你要让它进化成红莲铠骑吗！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E86795D4E4B94E020262026000A4F6089818BA95B838FDB531662107EA283B294E09A915417FF01FF1F00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我就用咒术之铠\n让炭小侍进化成苍炎刃鬼！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362115C3175285492672F4E4B94E0000A8BA970AD5C0F4F8D8FDB5316621082CD708E52039B3CFF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "上吧，炭小侍！\n用你那双手去获得苍炎之力……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0A5427FF0C70AD5C0F4F8DFF01000A75284F6090A353CC624B53BB83B75F9782CD708E4E4B529B20262026FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你就只用红莲铠骑这一只\n来和我的苍炎刃鬼对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C3153EA75287EA283B294E09A918FD94E0053EA000A6765548C6211768482CD708E52039B3C5BF962185427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "苍苍炎！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82CD82CD708EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咒术之铠……\n你要让它进化成苍炎刃鬼啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5492672F4E4B94E020262026000A4F6089818BA95B838FDB5316621082CD708E52039B3C554AFF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我就用庆祝之铠\n让炭小侍进化成红莲铠骑！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362115C3175285E86795D4E4B94E0000A8BA970AD5C0F4F8D8FDB531662107EA283B294E09A91FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "上吧，炭小侍！\n用你那双手去获得红莲之力……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0A5427FF0C70AD5C0F4F8DFF01000A75284F6090A353CC624B53BB83B75F977EA283B24E4B529B20262026FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你就只用苍炎刃鬼这一只\n来和我的红莲铠骑对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C3153EA752882CD708E52039B3C8FD94E0053EA000A6765548C621176847EA283B294E09A915BF962185427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "红莲莲！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7EA283B283B2FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让苍炎刃鬼和红莲铠骑\n来场命运之战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA982CD708E52039B3C548C7EA283B294E09A91000A6765573A547D8FD04E4B62185427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "都是苍炎刃鬼可不行。\n要苍炎刃鬼对决红莲铠骑才对。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90FD662F82CD708E52039B3C53EF4E0D884C3002000A898182CD708E52039B3C5BF951B37EA283B294E09A91624D5BF9300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯……毕竟这是命运之战。\n我会等到你愿意对战为止的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF202620266BD57ADF8FD9662F547D8FD04E4B62183002000A62114F1A7B4952304F60613F610F5BF962184E3A6B627684300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "终于能让苍炎刃鬼\n和红莲铠骑来场命运之战了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那么，就在我想到的\n最棒的场景对战吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7EC84E8E80FD8BA982CD708E52039B3C000A548C7EA283B294E09A916765573A547D8FD04E4B62184E86300200100001BE01000A90A34E48FF0C5C315728621160F352307684000A670068D27684573A666F5BF962185427300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想不到居然会以\n这种形式和你重逢……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F34E0D52305C4571364F1A4EE5000A8FD979CD5F625F0F548C4F6091CD9022202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呼……你让那时的炭小侍\n进化成红莲铠骑了啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "547C202620264F608BA990A365F6768470AD5C0F4F8D000A8FDB531662107EA283B294E09A914E86554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>……\n你还记得我们之间的第一次对战吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就是炭小侍之间的战斗。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000020262026000A4F608FD88BB05F9762114EEC4E4B95F476847B2C4E006B215BF962185417FF1F00100001BE00000A5C31662F70AD5C0F4F8D4E4B95F476846218659730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我赢了你",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118D624E864F600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你赢了我",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608D624E8662110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是那样的吗……？\n但我已经不是那时的我了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F90A368377684541720262026FF1F000A4F4662115DF27ECF4E0D662F90A365F6768462114E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
